    <string name="tv_mode">TV mode (HDMI)</string>
    <string name="tv_mode_help">When a TV is connected with a USB-C to HDMI cable, video plays fullscreen on the TV and this phone becomes the remote. If your phone only mirrors its screen, the app switches to fullscreen landscape instead. Touch the dimmed phone to brighten it for a few seconds.</string>

